      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Analysis of medical examination materials through loglinear method and logistic regression revealed high risk of shoulder pain syndrome in individuals subjected to physical overload of shoulder and to fluorides toxicity. Prevalence of shoulder pain syndrome is also influenced by concomitant visceral diseases. The results obtained support possible use of the method in occupational risk calculation."},
